---
import { withBase } from '@/engine/routing/paths';
import BaseLayout from '@/engine/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Cookie Policy';
const description = 'How cookies and similar technologies may be used on GameInsider.';
const updated = 'October 17, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title={`${title} | GameInsider`} description={description} path="/cookie-policy/">
  <div class="container section legal">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>This page explains how cookies and similar technologies may be used when you visit GameInsider. The cookies present on your device depend on which website features and third-party services are active.</p>

    <h2>What cookies do</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small files stored by a website or service in your browser. Similar technologies can help services remember settings, understand site activity or measure advertising.</p>

    <h2>Types of cookies</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Essential technologies:</strong> support core website delivery, security or functions you request.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> when enabled, help us understand traffic and how readers use the site.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> when advertising services are enabled, may help deliver ads, limit repeated displays and measure ad performance. Depending on your settings and applicable consent, advertising partners may also use information to personalise ads.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Managing your choices</h2>
    <p>You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings. Some site functions may not work as intended if certain cookies are blocked. Where applicable law requires consent for non-essential cookies or advertising technologies, the relevant consent mechanism should be used before those technologies are activated.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>Analytics and advertising providers may use their own technologies under their own policies. The providers involved depend on the services enabled on the site. Please review the relevant provider's information for details about its practices and available controls.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this page when our use of cookies or third-party services changes. The latest revision date appears at the top.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about this policy, please use our <a href={withBase('/contact/')}>contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>